#. module: woow_ai_task
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_task.field_woow_project_ai_connection__api_key
msgid ""
"LiteLLM (required): sent as \"Authorization: Bearer\" (a LiteLLM virtual "
"key: limits and budgets are set there). n8n (optional): the signing secret "
"of the X-Woow-Signature HMAC (never sent); without one requests are not "
"signed, e.g. for a public n8n Chat Trigger. Leave empty to keep the current "
"key; the saved key is never shown again. Changing the endpoint host or the "
"backend type removes the saved key, so it is never sent to another server: "
"enter it again."
msgstr ""
"LiteLLM（必填）：以「Authorization: Bearer」送出（LiteLLM 虛擬金鑰：限額與預算在 LiteLLM "
"設定）。n8n（選填）：X-Woow-Signature HMAC 的簽章金鑰（不會送出）；沒有設定時請求不簽章，例如公開的 n8n Chat "
"Trigger。留空則保留目前的金鑰；存檔後不再顯示。更換後端主機或後端類型會移除已存的金鑰，避免送到別的伺服器：請重新輸入。"

#. module: woow_ai_task
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:woow_ai_task.view_woow_project_ai_connection_form
msgid ""
"LiteLLM connections are chat-only: Odoo sends the conversation and never any tool,\n"
"                                so they are always safe for customers. Limits and budgets are set on the LiteLLM key."
msgstr "LiteLLM 連線只對話：Odoo 只送出對話內容、從不送工具，所以一律可給客戶使用。限額與預算在 LiteLLM 金鑰上設定。"

#. module: woow_ai_task
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task/models/ai_connection.py:0
msgid "LiteLLM connections are chat-only: they are always safe for customers."
msgstr "LiteLLM 連線只對話：一律可給客戶使用。"

#. module: woow_ai_task
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_task.field_woow_project_ai_connection__model
msgid "LiteLLM only. Leave empty to use the backend default."
msgstr "只用於 LiteLLM。留空則使用後端預設模型。"

#. module: woow_ai_task
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_task.field_woow_project_ai_connection__openai_stream
msgid ""
"LiteLLM only: ask for a streamed (SSE) answer. Bytes keep flowing while the "
"backend works, so proxies such as Cloudflare (about 100 seconds without "
"data) do not cut long answers. The call fails when no data arrives for 30 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"只用於 LiteLLM：要求串流（SSE）回應。後端處理時持續有資料傳回，Cloudflare 等代理（約 100 "
"秒沒有資料就中斷）不會切斷較長的回答。連續 30 秒沒有資料時，這次呼叫視為失敗。"

#. module: woow_ai_task
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_task.field_woow_project_ai_connection__document_mode
msgid ""
"LiteLLM only: how the documents users send (PDF, docx, xlsx, xls, csv, txt, "
"md, json) reach the model. \"Send the files\": each document is sent as it "
"is, as a file part with its own type (LiteLLM and OpenAI read PDF, Word and "
"Excel files); Odoo converts nothing. \"Download links only\": a signed "
"1-hour link, for a server that refuses file parts. Images are always sent "
"inline. Size limits: docs/PROTOCOL.md."
msgstr ""
"只用於 "
"LiteLLM：使用者傳送的文件（PDF、docx、xlsx、xls、csv、txt、md、json）如何交給模型。「把檔案送給模型」：每份文件以原本的類型、以檔案區塊原檔送出（LiteLLM"
" 與 OpenAI 讀得懂 PDF、Word、Excel），Odoo 不做任何轉換。「只給下載連結」：1 "
"小時有效的簽名連結，給不接受檔案區塊的伺服器。圖片一律直接附上。大小限制見 docs/PROTOCOL.md。"

#. module: woow_ai_task
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_task.field_woow_project_ai_connection__backend_type
msgid ""
"LiteLLM: Odoo sends the conversation to /v1/chat/completions and posts the "
"answer; it never sends tools, so the connection is chat-only. n8n: Odoo "
"sends the conversation to a webhook; what the workflow does (data lookups, "
"tools, memory) is up to the workflow."
msgstr ""
"LiteLLM：Odoo 把對話送到 /v1/chat/completions 並張貼回答；從不送工具，所以這種連線只對話。n8n：Odoo 把對話送到"
" webhook；流程做什麼（查資料、工具、記憶）由流程決定。"

#. module: woow_ai_task
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_task.field_woow_project_ai_connection__endpoint_url
msgid ""
"LiteLLM: the base URL ending in /v1 (…/chat/completions is added). n8n: the "
"full production webhook URL (a Chat Trigger: …/webhook/<id>/chat). Must be "
"https, except localhost and *.svc.cluster.local."
msgstr ""
"LiteLLM：以 /v1 結尾的基本網址（會自動加上 …/chat/completions）。n8n：完整的正式 webhook 網址（Chat "
"Trigger 是 …/webhook/<id>/chat）。必須是 https，localhost 與 *.svc.cluster.local 除外。"

