"The AI connection of \"%(name)s\" is not safe for customers. A system "
"administrator must check that n8n workflow and tick \"Safe for Customers\" "
"on its AI connection (Project > Configuration > Project AI > AI Connections)"
" only if it looks up no company data, calls no tools and keeps no memory; or"
" choose another AI assistant for the customer tab."
msgstr ""
"「%(name)s」的 AI 連線不可給客戶使用。請系統管理員檢查那個 n8n 流程：只有在它不查公司資料、不呼叫工具、也不記憶時，才在它的 AI "
"連線勾選「可給客戶使用」（專案 > 配置 > 專案 AI > AI 連線）；或替客戶分頁改選別的 AI 助理。"

