"The cron time limit (%(limit)s s) is shorter than the longest AI connection "
"timeout plus margins (%(required)s s). Set limit_time_real_cron to at least "
"%(required)s to process replies in the cron runner."
msgstr ""
"cron 時限（%(limit)s 秒）短於最長的 AI 連線逾時加上餘裕（%(required)s 秒）。把 limit_time_real_cron"
