#. module: woow_ai_task
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_task.field_woow_project_ai_connection__customer_safe
msgid ""
"The customer AI chat of a project may use this connection. LiteLLM "
"connections are chat-only (Odoo sends the conversation, never tools): always"
" safe. n8n: tick it only after checking that the workflow looks up no "
"company data, calls no tools and keeps no memory across conversations; it is"
" cleared when the endpoint URL or the backend type changes."
msgstr ""
"專案的客戶 AI 對話可以使用這條連線。LiteLLM 連線只對話（Odoo "
"只送出對話、從不送工具）：一律可以。n8n：請先確認流程不查公司資料、不呼叫工具、也不跨對話記憶，再勾選；更換後端網址或後端類型時會自動取消。"

#. module: woow_ai_task
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task/models/project_task.py:0
