"                        (colleagues with Project rights who can read the task and this project); with a customer AI assistant and a\n"
"                        project shared with portal users, a \"Customer AI chat\" (portal users who can read the task,\n"
"                        also on the portal task page). The internal AI answers every message of the colleagues; the\n"
"                        customer AI answers the customers and pauses after a colleague writes. System administrators\n"
"                        prepare the AI assistants and their AI connections (Project &gt; Configuration &gt; Project AI)."
msgstr ""
"設定了內部用 AI 助理時，這個專案的每張任務都有「內部 AI 對話」（有專案權限、能讀取任務和這個專案的同事）；設定了客戶用 AI "
"助理、而且專案分享給 portal 使用者時，還有「客戶 AI 對話」（能讀取任務的 portal 使用者，也顯示在 portal 任務頁）。內部 AI"
" 回覆同事的每一則訊息；客戶 AI 回覆客戶，同事發言後會暫停。AI 助理和 AI 連線由系統管理員準備（專案 &gt; 配置 &gt; 專案 AI）。"

